From: VyOS ARM64 Builder maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Orange Pi: backport DW-DP audio and internal SPDIF2 route

Audio adapted from Sebastian Reichel v11 21/21 and SDP lifetime/locking
from 16/21 and 18/21. Original author: Sebastian Reichel <sebastian.reichel@collabora.com>
https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260806-synopsys-dw-dp-improvements-v11-21-0d508505f383@collabora.com/

Keep 6.18 bound-controller power semantics. Serialize modeset reset with
ALSA callbacks; defer audio registers until video enabled. Zero SDP data,
check register reads, preserve allocation errors during cleanup.
Hardware validation pending; see README.md.

